  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Land Use Action Tracker , to provide annual assessments of whether land use policies are on track to meet Paris Agreement targets and support climate change resilience  is a component of Investments in Forests and Sustainable Land Use reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;717,410. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Forestry policy and administrative management, Agricultural land resources.</narrative>
  </description>
